on enterFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  2] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  4] extcall 26 .............................. <sprite(1)>
  [  6] pushcons 0 .............................. <EMPTY>
  [  8] pushsymb 681 ............................ <#cursor>
  [ 11] pusharglist 3 ........................... <sprite(1), EMPTY, #cursor>
  [ 13] objcall 682 ............................. <sprite(1).getFlashProperty(EMPTY, #cursor)>
  [ 16] setlocal 0 .............................. c = sprite(1).getFlashProperty(EMPTY, #cursor)
  [ 18] getlocal 0 .............................. <c>
  [ 20] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 22] eq ...................................... <c = 2>
  [ 23] jmpifz [ 40] ............................ if c = 2 then / else
  [ 26] gettoplevelprop 683 ..................... <_player>
  [ 29] pushint16 280 ........................... <280>
  [ 32] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <_player, 280>
  [ 34] objcall 681 ............................. _player.cursor(280)
  [ 37] jmp [ 49]
  [ 40] gettoplevelprop 683 ..................... <_player>
  [ 43] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 44] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <_player, 0>
  [ 46] objcall 681 ............................. _player.cursor(0)
  [ 49] ret
end
